{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁ֫לַח","hw":"שֶׁ֫לַח","html":"I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫לַח</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>missile, weapon, sprout</strong> (late);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:8\" href=\"/Joel.2.8\">Jo 2:8</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁ֑לַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.11\">Ne 4:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:18\" href=\"/Job.33.18\">Jb 33:18</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁלְחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.17\">Ne 4:17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.10\">2 Ch 23:10</a>, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>missile, weapon</em>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.11\">Ne 4:11</a> and v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.17\">17</a> (where <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּיִם</span> corrupt; read probably <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּימִינוֹ</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיָדוֹ</span>; v. Ryle Be-Ry Berthol), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.10\">2 Ch 23:10</a> (disting. from <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָגֵן</span>); coll. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.5\">32:5</a> and <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבַר בַּשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:18\" href=\"/Job.33.18\">Jb 33:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:12\" href=\"/Job.36.12\">36:12</a> (<em>perish by</em> or < <em>rush upon</em> [and perish]), <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:8\" href=\"/Joel.2.8\">Jo 2:8</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בעד\" href=\"/BDB,_בעד\", dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַד</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>sprout, shoot</em> (cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁלּוּחִים\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁלּוּחִים\", dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלוּחָה</a>], and √ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:12\" href=\"/Psalms.80.12\">ψ 80:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">Je 17:8</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלָחַיִךְ פַּרְדֵּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.13\">Ct 4:13</a> (fig.; meaning? Perles<sup>Anal. 63</sup> proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנֵי לְחָיַיִךְ</span> <em>thy two cheeks</em>); + prob. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.5\">Ez 31:5</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּשְׁלָחָיו</span> Co Toy al., or <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשִׁלְחֵי</span> [with v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.6\">6</a>] Krae).","next":"BDB, שֶׁ֫לַח²","prev":"BDB, שָׁלַח"}